        "description": "TypeScript/Node.js SDK for HipCortex. Wraps the Rust binary REST API. Documents multi-tier memory ingestion, world model rollout prediction, causal PPR graph search, and GDPR forget. Integrates with Vercel AI SDK / streamText pattern."
